Description: GPU page for Qualcomm Adreno (msm) GPUs
 The msm DRM card is a platform device (no PCI ID, no gpu_busy_percent, no hwmon), so Resources showed an
 unnamed "GPU" page with no data. New msm backend: name from the Adreno chip id, total usage from the msm
 DRM fdinfo counters, clock from devfreq, temperature from the gpuss thermal zones, shared memory in use
 against MemTotal. Per-process GPU usage/memory now also covers msm clients.
